+/-!
+Regression test: an omega step (`EqCnstr.elimNonUnit`) below a Cooper split creates new cutsat
+variables. The conflict found there is used after backtracking, so the variables must survive it;
+otherwise the variable context of the proof lacks them and the kernel rejects it.
+-/
+
+example (x : Int) (h : (3 * x + 3) % 8 ≤ (3 * x + x % 4) % 8) (h2 : 2 * x % 8 < (5 * x + 3) % 8) : False := by
+  lia
+
+example (x0 : Fin 8) : x0 + x0 < 3 + x0 * 5 → 3 + 3 * x0 ≤ x0 * 3 + x0 % 4 → False := by
+  grind
